  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.6.1-beta.9`\n\n### Fixes\n\n- stop id-less OSC 8 links from piling up while a TUI redraws them: xterm 6 gives every link without an id its own entry and marker, freed only once its line leaves the scrollback, so a link redrawn in place leaked about 3 KB per frame; an id-less link now reuses the entry with the same URI already on that line of the same buffer, installed for terminal tabs and the log replay player ([11ecd9af](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/11ecd9af3c41a9daceee4023fa3436e8ef6ae1b1))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.6.1-beta.9...v0.6.1-beta.10](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.6.1-beta.9...v0.6.1-beta.10)",
